EN:
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}You've done a great job helping the
museum out with this collection,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}It's finally become the kind of
attraction everyone in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
can be proud of.

{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Say what you will about {{TAG:0005:0005:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but our museum is second to none.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Just look at this collection!
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}It's quite an accomplishment to
collect so many rare specimens.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Di' quello che ti pare su {{TAG:0005:0005:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ma non toccarmi il suo museo.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Dico, guarda qua che collezione!
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Una raccolta così completa di fossili
è un traguardo straordinario
per la nostra città.
